            "testimonial_1_location": "Delhi",
            "testimonial_2_enabled": true,
            "testimonial_2_quote": "As a cardiologist, I recommend olive oil to every patient. But most bottles here are oxidized before they leave the warehouse. AIWO's peroxide value of below 15 —I've never seen numbers that good in India. This is what EVOO should be.",
