            "testimonial_3_enabled": true,
            "testimonial_3_quote": "We tested 12 'extra virgin' oils for our restaurant—most were refined junk. AIWO was the only one with DAGs above 70%. The color, the aroma, the finish... this is what Italian nonnas would approve of.",
